---
description: Antigravity slash commands load skills on demand from ~/.cursor/skills
alwaysApply: true
---

Antigravity Awesome Skills v13.1.1 is installed at `~/.cursor/skills/`.

## How to invoke skills

- **Slash command (preferred):** `/skill-name` — thin wrappers live in `~/.cursor/commands/<skill-name>.md`
- **Chat mention:** `@skill-name` in Cursor chat

Do not inline or guess skill content. When the user runs a slash command or names a skill, read `~/.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` first, then follow it.

## Resync after skill updates

```bash
npx antigravity-awesome-skills --cursor
bash scripts/sync-cursor-skill-commands.sh
```

## Starter skills for this repo

- `/systematic-debugging` — bugs and test failures
- `/test-driven-development` — TDD workflow
- `/api-security-best-practices` — webhook/API hardening
- `/testing-patterns` — Jest unit/integration tests
- `/fallow` — code-health audit before finishing changes
- `/ponytail` — minimal-diff senior dev mode

Bundles catalog: `~/.cursor/skills/docs/users/bundles.md`
